OL,3,GNEWSAPolice hunt teenage robbers after
OL,4,Ashopkeeper threatened
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village shop was robbed by two
OL,7,Fteenagers wearing balaclavas, say
OL,8,FSurrey Police.
OL,10,FThe force said the incident took place
OL,11,Fat about 20:20 BST on Friday at Ewell
OL,12,FVillage Store on Kingston Road.
OL,14,FPolice said that two youngsters,
OL,15,Fbelieved to be aged about 17,
OL,16,Fthreatened the shopkeeper.
OL,18,FOne was described as approximately 5ft
OL,19,F8in (1.72m) and slim, wearing a black
OL,20,Fhat with multi-coloured crosses ending
OL,21,Fin arrow heads and white paint
OL,22,Fsplashes, and black Nike trainers.
